400 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\043\043\043 Quick summary \043\043\043\015\n\015\nDuring this meeting\054 Barelvi\054 Mifthahul\054 and Manullang discussed various topics related to configuration\054 Wi\055Fi settings\054 and network connectivity\056 They also mentioned the need for documentation and the importance of proper setup and testing\056\015\n\015\n\043\043\043 Action items for Barelvi \043\043\043\015\n\055 \133 \135 Review the documentation and provide feedback\056\015\n\055 \133 \135 Configure the Wi\055Fi settings according to the discussed requirements\056\015\n\015\n\043\043\043 Action items for Mifthahul \043\043\043\015\n\055 \133 \135 Update the user manual with the latest information\056\015\n\055 \133 \135 Test the network connectivity and ensure proper functioning\056\015\n\015\n\043\043\043 Action items for Manullang \043\043\043\015\n\055 \133 \135 Provide assistance in configuring the network settings\056\015\n\055 \133 \135 Collaborate with Barelvi to test the Wi\055Fi connectivity and troubleshoot any issues\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 401 0 R
     /Pg 370 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

